        "TextContent": {
          "Namespace": "",
          "Key": "38DCC8D041BAE13B7ED7B89B603D7CEA",
          "SourceString": "就是，人在高兴的时候，喝咖啡也是会醉的……",
          "LocalizedString": "Basicallly, when you're really happy, even coffee can make you feel tipsy..."
