        "TextContent": {
          "Namespace": "",
          "Key": "B52B6D96443D261E1F860CACBE731D41",
          "SourceString": "回想起来，今天一天遇到的都是令人愉快的事情。",
          "LocalizedString": "Looking back, the day was packed with delightful moments."
