          "Key": "FB3B39A04FAA8A1A6B064096B12EDEF8",
          "SourceString": "不光是指礼物和祝福，能一整天都看到大家毫无保留的笑容，我感觉很幸福。",
          "LocalizedString": "It wasn't just the gifts and wishes; seeing everyone's genuine smiles all day brought me so much joy."
